  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-05-10T16:34:18.589Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Making VRChat worlds more discoverable is essential for creators.  However, the main link to VRChat worlds right now requires a login.  The only way for worlds to be viewable without a login is to create an instance link, and then make sure to only copy the long version, as the short link expires. As you can imagine, this is not intuitive for creators just looking to promote their content. \n  The instance link also does not contain essential info such as player cap, download size, tags, and ***platforms supported***.\nI would suggest that any world link from a not-logged-in user should not redirect to the login page, it should redirect to a publicly-viewable version of the world, with better world info, and a prominent \"Login to visit\" type call to action button.\nThe use for this is to allow easier access for external discoverability, such as review sites, press, social media, etc, in order to bring people into VRChat to view specific content.",
